                        <field name="dc_title">With news that the Council had that in the shadow of the so-called new institutions... several leaflets with the title of political and religious catechisms were printed and circulated in the Kingdom,..., and even that some of them were received in the schools of first letters for the teaching of childhood, moved of just zeal for the best performance... so that through the schools they were not printed in the heart of the maximum youth contrary to the Religion and the State... </field>
